---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms of Service for Canadian Data Insights — acceptance, data limitations, intellectual property, and Open Government Licence."
  canonicalPath="/terms/"
>
  <section class="bg-background py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl font-bold text-primary sm:text-5xl">
          Terms of <span class="text-tertiary">Service</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
          By using Canadian Data Insights, you agree to these terms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8 font-sans leading-relaxed text-on-surface">
        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-4 font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-primary">
            1. Acceptance of Terms
          </h2>
          <p>
            By accessing and utilizing Canadian Data Insights ("the Service"), you accept and
            agree to be bound by the terms and provisions of this agreement. If you do not
            agree to abide by these terms, please do not use this site.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-4 font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-primary">
            2. Use of Data &amp; Limitations
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            The demographic data provided is sourced from Statistics Canada and is presented
            for informational and educational purposes only. While we strive to ensure the
            accuracy of our data parsing pipelines, Canadian Data Insights makes no
            warranties, expressed or implied, regarding the absolute accuracy, reliability, or
            completeness of the visualizations.
          </p>
          <p>
            You agree not to hold Canadian Data Insights liable for any business, financial,
            or personal decisions made based on the information provided on this platform.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-4 font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-primary">
            3. Intellectual Property
          </h2>
          <p>
            The layout, design, UI components, code, and proprietary parsing mechanisms of
            this website are the property of Canadian Data Insights. The underlying
            demographic data is the property of the Government of Canada under the Open
            Government Licence - Canada.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-4 font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-primary">
            4. Open Government Licence
          </h2>
          <p>
            Users are free to copy, modify, publish, translate, adapt, distribute or otherwise
            use the data visualizations presented as long as they comply with the standard
            terms of the{' '}
            <a
              href="https://open.canada.ca/en/open-government-licence-canada"
              class="text-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-tertiary"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              Open Government Licence - Canada
            </a>
            , which includes acknowledging Statistics Canada as the source of the raw data.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
